# Build context hygiene for web/Dockerfile (ADR-021). The context is ./web, so this file — not the
# repo-root .dockerignore — is the one that applies.
#
# The env exclusion is the load-bearing one: the Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, and web/.env.local
# holds AUTH_SECRET and the Google OAuth pair. Without this line those values would be baked into a
# build layer. The app reads its env at runtime, which is the only place it is ever needed.
node_modules
.next
out
.vercel
coverage
.env*
*.tsbuildinfo
